BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 207.80 Tm (events with dated supporting records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 185.57 Tm (Build an initial 400-account research universe, then remove accounts lacking a relevant trigger, reachable role or viable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 170.35 Tm (remedy. An illustrative campaign retains 160 evidence-qualified contacts, generates 32 substantive replies, books 16) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 155.12 Tm (discovery calls, qualifies ten opportunities and signs six mandates. That is a 40% research-to-contact yield, 20%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 139.90 Tm (contact-to-reply rate, 50% reply-to-call rate, 62.5% call-to-qualified rate and 60% qualified-to-signed rate. These are) Tj ET
